{
  "comment": [
    "Per-package cmake args, auto-discovered by colcon when it runs with the",
    "workspace root as cwd (colcon's --metas defaults to ./colcon.meta).",
    "",
    "livox_ros_driver2: upstream never intends its CMakeLists to be configured by a",
    "bare `colcon build` -- its own build.sh always passes these two flags. Without",
    "DISTRO_ROS the CMakeLists takes a pre-Humble branch that sets",
    "LIVOX_INTERFACES_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES via get_target_property on a target name",
    "that no longer exists under Humble, and configure dies with NOTFOUND. Rather",
    "than patch the submodule (it is pinned upstream, unmodified), we reproduce the",
    "flags build.sh would have passed. ROS_EDITION would default correctly today,",
    "but it is spelled out because the CMakeLists tests it with STREQUAL and an",
    "empty value silently means ROS2 by accident, not by intent.",
    "",
    "behaviortree_cpp_v3 / vizionsdk_ros2: their own tests and examples are not",
    "built. Nothing runs them (both are pinned upstream, unmodified), and BT.CPP's",
    "gtest suite + examples were a good part of its ~2 min in every CI build. The",
    "BT.CPP library, sample_nodes and tools are unaffected. small_gicp's tests and",
    "examples already default to OFF; Livox-SDK2 has no switch for its samples."
  ],
  "names": {
    "behaviortree_cpp_v3": {
      "cmake-args": [
        "-DBUILD_UNIT_TESTS=OFF",
        "-DBUILD_EXAMPLES=OFF"
      ]
    },
    "vizionsdk_ros2": {
      "cmake-args": [
        "-DBUILD_TESTING=OFF"
      ]
    },
    "livox_ros_driver2": {
      "cmake-args": [
        "-DROS_EDITION=ROS2",
        "-DDISTRO_ROS=humble"
      ]
    }
  }
}
